guide forever/horde/skyborne/01-zephras-isle
title Zephras Isle
faction Horde
race Skyborne
levels 1-15
zone Zephras Isle
coords live
next forever/horde/02-the-barrens

# Route: the simulator's consensus route for Horde Skyborne
# (data/sim/export/consensus-horde-skyborne, visit 1, levels 1-14.6).
# Checked against the 2026-10-14 export: same isle quests. Its order differs
# mostly at the end (Windsong Lake and Shadowgale Forest before the Valanaar
# and Shrine of Akir finale), but its isle visit is slower than the one this
# guide was built from (4.61 h against 4.56 h), so the order below stays.
#
# Flow: Thendal Village -> Thendal Grove and the standing stones -> the Ursera
# den and the Al'Aketh camp -> Shen'dar Village -> the highland bandits ->
# Falaath Village -> the West Pylon Watchtower and the hippogryph nests ->
# Valanaar -> Windfield Orchard -> the East Pylon Watchtower -> the turncoat
# in the Gustberry Lowlands -> the Shrine of Akir -> Shadowgale Forest and
# Windsong Lake -> Lorthuna in the Rohashi Spires -> the airship to Mulgore
# -> the Crossroads (flight path and hearth bind, as on the simulator's route).
# The isle has no inn and no flight path.
#
# Optional extra: WANTED: Vulgara the Insatiable (93318). Vulgara is elite,
# so the simulator leaves it out; it stays as an optional step for groups.
#
# Deviations from the export:
# - Thendal Village: the Ursera, Hanaa's camp and the Urs'anah den are done
#   in one loop west of the village; Valreaa's turn-in waits for that return.
# - Shen'dar: the hippogryph nests (92516, 93951) and the Small Eggs of
#   Restocking the Larders (92553) move from before the first Falaath trip to
#   the second southern loop (Falaath -> West Pylon -> nests -> Shen'dar). The
#   export walks to the nests and back on its own, then goes south twice;
#   this saves one round trip. Strider Meat comes from the Galestriders that
#   share the meadows with the Prideclaws.
# - The Ripped Missive (94490) is accepted from Commander Haalien's drop in
#   the Al'Aketh camp; The Fate of the Den (94491) goes to Lotheluum on the
#   way back through Valanaar.
# - Welcome to Shen'dar Village (92514) is taken from Constable Aonda when
#   The Next Step is handed in, not on the later visit: the talk to Illaya
#   for The Windshapers then counts for it too, and only Coriella is left.
# - Class training: added at Shen'dar (about 9), Valanaar (about 12) and
#   before leaving the isle (about 14); every class has a trainer in each
#   town, and the next guide would otherwise be the first training since 6.
#
# Class quests on the isle:
# - Shaman: Call of Earth (92466-92468) from Windshaper Boro at 4; the Signet
#   of Akir drops from the Al'Aketh by Hanaa's camp, the Minor Manifestation
#   of Earth is at the Rise of Spirits east of the village. Call of Fire
#   (97243-97257, Searing Totem, the Fire Totem and the Totem of Charged
#   Flames) at about 12: Sessaria Skystride in Valanaar, Olariaan Swiftburn
#   at the Shrine of Flames,
#   Skypriest Faladiel west of the falls, Kuramaa in the Shen'dar Highlands,
#   then the Eternal Flame run back to Valanaar. The Barrens Call of Fire
#   (1524-1527) is not taken.
# - Druid: The Great Ursera Spirit / Strength and Mercy (94006, 94638, Bear
#   Form): Lotheluum in Valanaar, Urs'endris by the falls north of the East
#   Pylon Watchtower, Ur'endra near the turncoat's house. On Kalimdor, Muln
#   Earthfury at the landing sends you to Turak Runetotem in Thunder Bluff
#   (Child of Nature 94911), who teaches Teleport: Moonglade (94913, handed
#   to Dendrite on the Cat Form trip in forever/horde/04-the-barrens). The
#   data has no Skyborne Aquatic Form quest; the Tauren one (27-31) is not
#   offered to Skyborne.
# - Warrior: The Skybreaker Bulwark (94003, Defensive Stance): Seena
#   Skybreaker in Valanaar, Zaal Stormshield at the Shrine of Akir.
# - Hunter: Taming the Beast (94978, 94979, 94013) and Training the Beast
#   (94050) with Quel'ana Quickgale in Valanaar: a Windsong Crawler by the
#   lakes north-west of town, a Vuldren Alpha at the orchard, an Ornery
#   Galestrider in the fields west of town, done after the orchard.
# - Class letters at 2: once Harmony in Balance (92461) is turned in, Rorian
#   gives each class its trainer quest, handed in with the level 4 turn-ins
#   in the village, just before training (nothing to learn before then):
#   The Warrior's Path (92532) to Blademaster Ren in the
#   watchtower; The Way of the Hunter (92482) to Tai'ree Farsight; Embracing
#   the Elements (92484) to Windshaper Boro; A Student of Nature (92485) to
#   Xyton Silverwind. Rogue: At Home in the Shadows (92483): Rorian to Akeri
#   Duskblade in the watchtower, at the level 4 turn-ins (no spell).
#
# Added: The Earthen Ring (95349). The export accepts it but never turns it
# in; its ender, Alaana Stormwalker, stands where the airship lands, so it is
# turned in there at no cost.
# Welcome to Azeroth (95350) is accepted from Alaana there and carried to
# Thrall in forever/horde/03-silverpine-forest; its follow-up, Journey to the
# Crossroads (98024), goes to Thork in forever/horde/04-the-barrens.
# The Thunder Bluff flight path is learned on the way past the bluff: later
# guides fly there.
# Added: Traditions of the Bluff (97485, Forever orientation quest, also in
# the Tauren export's Thunder Bluff stop): buy four incense parts from the
# city's vendors near Tal and spread the incense on Hunter Rise, while you
# are in the city for the flight path. Simulator: +0.04 h to level 20 (the
# hours to 30 and 60 came out lower, 24.53 h and 122.09 h against 24.70 h and
# 122.71 h without it).
# Left out: Exploring the Horde (93739, Forever, Skyborne only): the capital
# tour (Nazgrel, Vol'jin, Cairne, Sylvanas) starts from Thrall only once
# Welcome to Azeroth is turned in, which happens in
# forever/horde/03-silverpine-forest. More Al'Aketh Ears (93459, Forever): a
# repeatable reputation hand-in for Vayn Moongaze with no XP.

