# ---------------------------------------------------------------- To the Crossroads

step The airship
  tip The Horde airship docks at the south-west edge of Valanaar. Ride it to Kalimdor; it lands in northern Mulgore.
  goto 57.92,80.78 "Horde airship"

step Northern Mulgore
  zone Mulgore
  tip You leave the isle for good. Alaana Stormwalker waits where the airship lands.
  turnin 95349                        -- Alaana Stormwalker
  accept 95350                        -- Alaana Stormwalker: keep it, Thrall in Orgrimmar comes two guides later
  accept 94911 only Druid             -- Muln Earthfury, by the landing: for Turak Runetotem in Thunder Bluff

step Thunder Bluff
  zone Thunder Bluff
  tip Thunder Bluff is beside the landing: ride up a lift and learn the flight path from Tal, the wind rider master.
  getfp "Thunder Bluff" npc 2995      -- Tal

step Traditions of the Bluff
  zone Thunder Bluff
  tip Eylah Sunhorn wants tauren incense: buy its four parts from Nida the herbalist, Nata the enchanting supplier, Mahu the leatherworking supplier and Naal the cooking supplier, then combine them into Prepared Incense.
  accept 97485                        -- Eylah Sunhorn
  buy 278079 x1 npc 3014              -- Bundle of Herbs, from Nida Winterhoof
  buy 278080 x1 npc 3012              -- Bundle of Dried Cedar Twigs, from Nata Dawnstrider
  buy 278081 x1 npc 3005              -- Sinew Thread, from Mahu
  buy 278083 x1 npc 3027              -- Ceremonial Flint and Tinder, from Naal Mistrunner

step Hunter Rise
  zone Thunder Bluff
  tip Use the Prepared Incense at the ceremonial mat and burner on the south-facing cliff of Hunter Rise.
  use 278078 quest 97485.2 @53.3,87.9 "Spread the Prepared Incense off Hunter Rise"

