step The Crossroads
  zone The Barrens
  tip Leave Thunder Bluff by a lift and follow the road south past Bloodhoof Village and through the eastern pass into the Barrens; from the pass, take the Gold Road north to the Crossroads, the Horde town in the middle of the Barrens.
  getfp "Crossroads" npc 3615         -- Devrak, the wind rider master
  sethome "The Crossroads" npc 3934   -- Innkeeper Boorand Plainswind
